    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) 300 millions d&#x2019;enfants suppl&#xe9;mentaires vaccin&#xe9;s; 2) 82 nouveaux programmes de vaccination introduits; 3) 7 &#xe0; 8 millions de vies suppl&#xe9;mentaires sauv&#xe9;es; 4) 80 &#xe0; 100 milliards de dollars am&#xe9;ricains d&#x2019;avantages &#xe9;conomiques g&#xe9;n&#xe9;r&#xe9;s.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes for this project include: (1) 300 million additional children immunized; (2) 82 new vaccine programs introduced; (3) 7 to 8 million additional lives saved; and (4) US$ 80 to 100 billion in economic benefits produced.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
